B.aFr={Ninjas:0,"Big-Littles":1,"Painting the Rock":2,Retreat:3,"Hackathon & Design Jam":4,KTPalooza:5,"Lightning Talks":6}
B.Nq=new A.bc(B.aFr,["Every pledge is given a plastic ninja, KTP's token and mascot. They must carry it with them throughout their entire pledging semester, and cannot be caught without their ninja. The ninja is one of our oldest pledge class traditions and that brothers continue to cherish throughout their college experience.","Mid-semester the pledges are paired with a brother to be their big (based on preference). Each brother fits into a lineage tracing back to the founders of KTP! Additionally, pledges are paired with their professional bigs, who offer specific classes, career, and recruiting advice as well as 1-1 support.","On crossover, every semester pledges paint the rock with the letters \u039a\u0398\u03a0 and their names. They all stand across the street in a line alphabetically and cross the street as they are welcomed into the fraternity as brothers and given a gift from their bigs.","Since 2021, brothers go on a retreat in Michigan or bordering states for a weekend full of activities and bonding. Cooking? Volleyball? Smash tournament? Pool party? You name it, KTP Retreat has something for everyone.","Full-day annual event started in Fall 2019 for members to have a project creation opportunity. Brothers create project teams based on similar interests or pledge class, and points are offered based off of attendance and deliverables.",'Born as the "KTP Hype Week", KTPalooza is an annual week of challenges where randomized teams fight for the cup, spanning everywhere from wholesome tasks to competitions. It encourages bonding among the fraternity while providing the best memories for some of our members.',"Lightning Talks are a great opportunity for brothers to give a presentation about any of their interests to the fraternity. Examples include study abroad trips, glitch art, video game economies, keyboard shortcuts, the history of Halloween, and more!"],t.l)
