$.cC6=function(){var s=t.N
return A.K(["VP of Internal Affairs","Help brothers manage their points and participation within the fraternity\nLead internal DEI efforts to ensure KTP is a safe and inclusive space for all brothers and incoming members\nMake sure everyone has a smooth experience in the organization, being heard, respected, and valued","VP of Engagement","Coordinate events that promote bonding within the fraternity and the community\nArrange a variety of events throughout the semester and maintain a calendar for fraternity-related events\nPlan and carry out events that members show excitement about and want to see","VP of Marketing","Maintain the fraternity's social media presence and develop its digital strategy\nPromote KTP across the entire university to attract a diverse range of majors and people\nCreate apparel for brothers","VP of Membership","Organize rush events and pledge requirements, acting as a liaison between potential members and the Executive Board\nEngage active brothers and support rushees throughout the KTP rush process\nCultivate close friendships in every pledge class and successfully integrate them into the KTP brotherhood","VP of External Affairs","Connect with KTP alumni through panels, coffee chats, and mentorship, bringing past and present members together\nFoster strong relationships with other chapters and expand KTP to more schools\nPartner with other student organizations to increase campus involvement","VP of Finance","Keep accurate records and control of the fraternity's finances\nMaintain financial transparency within KTP and increase financial literacy for all brothers\nLead efforts for additional fundraising opportunities for the fraternity from the university and other sources","President","Raise awareness for KTP across campus and cater to all of those with an interest in tech\nMaintain open and honest communication with the fraternity and E-Board\nSupport Executive Board members to help them faithfully complete their duties\nOrganize bigger and better events to create lasting memories for all members","VP of Professional Development","Ensure brothers know how to pursue their preferred career and roles\nExpand KTP knowledge database to increase resources for brothers\nIncrease general knowledge about the tech industry throughout the fraternity\nMake sure brothers feel confident and prepared for all stages of the recruiting cycle no matter their major","VP of Technical Development","Encourage a sense of curiosity and passion for tech in our brothers by engaging in activities and events\nOversee committees and plan workshops, Lightning Talks, hackathons, design jams, and more\nProvide access to resources and opportunities to learn and engage with technology"],s,s)}()
